---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LongTermApplianceRentalIsland from '../components/islands/LongTermApplianceRentalIsland';

const serviceSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Service",
  "name": "Long-Term Appliance Rental",
  "description": "Long-term washer and dryer rental in Ocean Springs, MS with free delivery, installation, and maintenance included.",
  "provider": {
    "@type": "LocalBusiness",
    "@id": "https://www.sudsycorentals.com/#localbusiness",
    "name": "Sudsy Co. Rentals",
    "telephone": "+1-228-338-3455",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "streetAddress": "1302 Fort St",
      "addressLocality": "Ocean Springs",
      "addressRegion": "MS",
      "postalCode": "39564",
      "addressCountry": "US"
    }
  },
  "areaServed": {
    "@type": "State",
    "name": "Mississippi"
  },
  "url": "https://www.sudsycorentals.com/long-term-appliance-rental/",
  "offers": {
    "@type": "Offer",
    "price": "59.99",
    "priceCurrency": "USD",
    "priceSpecification": {
      "@type": "UnitPriceSpecification",
      "price": "59.99",
      "priceCurrency": "USD",
      "unitText": "month"
    }
  }
};

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.sudsycorentals.com" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Long-Term Appliance Rental" }
  ]
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Long-Term Appliance Rental Ocean Springs MS | Sudsy Co."
  description="Long-term appliance rental in Ocean Springs, MS. Rent a washer and dryer starting at $59.99/mo with free delivery and installation. No credit check."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(serviceSchema)} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)} />
  <h1 class="sr-only">Long-Term Appliance Rental in Ocean Springs, MS</h1>
  <LongTermApplianceRentalIsland client:only="react" />

  <!-- Rich SEO content — server rendered -->
  <section class="bg-muted/30 py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl">
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Why Long-Term Rental Often Beats Buying</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Here's the honest math. A decent washer and dryer set runs $800–$1,500 new. Add delivery, haul-away, and installation and you're closer to $1,000–$1,800 out of pocket on day one. Then there's repairs — expect $200–$500 every few years on average.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">At $59.99/mo from Sudsy Co., you break even with a mid-range purchase somewhere around 18–25 months — and that's before counting any repair bills. For renters who move every year or two, the math almost never favors buying.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Long-term rental also means:
</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4">
  <li><strong>No repair costs</strong> — if it breaks, we fix or replace it</li>
  <li><strong>No moving headaches</strong> — we pick it up when you leave</li>
  <li><strong>No depreciation</strong> — you're not sitting on a used appliance that's hard to sell</li>
  <li><strong>No upfront cost</strong> — your first month is just $59.99</li>
</ul>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Who Chooses Long-Term Appliance Rental</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed"><strong>Renters who move every 1-3 years.</strong> Moving is already expensive enough. Renting your appliances means one less thing to haul, store, or negotiate with a new landlord about.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed"><strong>Households that prefer predictable monthly costs.</strong> A $59.99/mo line item is easier to budget around than an unpredictable repair bill.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed"><strong>People who don't want the hassle of appliance ownership.</strong> Some folks just don't want to deal with it. That's a completely valid reason.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed"><strong>Landlords and property owners.</strong> Providing in-unit laundry through a rental arrangement keeps your capital free and your maintenance exposure low.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Long-Term Rental Pricing</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">| Plan | Monthly Rate | Includes | |------|-------------|----------| | Basic | $59.99/mo | Standard-capacity washer & dryer set |
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Month-to-month. No contracts. No cancellation fees. Cancel anytime.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: We Handle Everything</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Free delivery to your address. Free installation by our team. If the machine ever has a problem — mechanical issue, won't spin, won't drain — you call us and we take care of it. That's the deal.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">We serve all of Jackson County and Harrison County on the Mississippi Gulf Coast:
</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4">
  <li>Ocean Springs</li>
  <li>Biloxi</li>
  <li>Gulfport</li>
  <li>D'Iberville</li>
  <li>Pascagoula</li>
  <li>Gautier</li>
  <li>Long Beach</li>
  <li>Pass Christian</li>
  <li>Moss Point</li>
</ul>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Start Your Long-Term Appliance Rental</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Call <strong>(228) 338-3455</strong> or <a href="#" class="text-primary hover:underline">get started online</a>. Next-day delivery is available across most of our service area.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed"><strong>Sudsy Co. Washer and Dryer Rentals</strong> Locally owned. Ocean Springs, MS. Serving the Mississippi Gulf Coast.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
